  "helpTitle6": "Smart Review",
  "helpTitle7": "Mini Game: Flow Letter",
  "helpBody1": "The app offers 3 separate ways to practise, to build every skill:\n\n• Paragraph: Focuses on writing and translating longer texts. You write a paragraph from a prompt, then AI scores it and makes the style sound natural.\n\n• Sentence: Tackles grammar and structure mistakes in single sentences. Good for a quick review of basic grammar rules.\n\n• Conversation: Builds your speaking reflexes. Includes 'Scripted' mode (set situations such as travel or interviews) and 'Free' mode (open chat with AI).",
  "helpBody2": "After every exercise, AI gives a detailed breakdown so you understand your mistakes:\n\n1. Spotting mistakes: Red marks grammar or vocabulary errors to fix.\n2. Better phrasing: Green shows more natural or more accurate ways to say it in context.\n3. Detailed explanations: Tap a marked mistake or suggestion to see the language rule behind it, or why the suggestion works better.",
  "helpBody3": "AI Magic Generator lets you design your own learning path from real needs instead of fixed lessons:\n\n1. How to use it: Enter any topic or situation (for example 'Job interview', 'Email complaining about a service', 'Shopping conversation').\n2. Customise: Choose a difficulty from Basic to Advanced so the exercises match your level.\n3. Result: AI reads your request and creates exercises (Writing or Conversation) directly about that topic.",
  "helpBody4": "A built-in system helps you save and review words well with spaced repetition:\n\n1. Collecting words: While practising, tap any word you don't know to see its meaning, then tap 'Save' to add it to your collection.\n2. How review works: The app works out when to remind you about saved words based on how well you remember them (Again, Good, Easy).\n3. Library: Organise word decks by topic so you can focus on specific groups of words.",
  "helpBody5": "Tools that help you see how your learning goes over time:\n\n1. Calendar: Shows each day you studied this month in a clear calendar view.\n2. Streak: Counts the days in a row you practised, to build a daily habit.\n3. Badges: Milestones that recognise your effort when you reach certain learning goals.",
  "helpBody6": "Review keeps your whole learning history so you can strengthen what you've learned:\n\n1. Look back: Open any past exercise at any time, with AI's corrections and detailed notes.\n2. Redo: Do a finished exercise again to see how much you've improved since last time.",
  "helpBody7": "An extra way to learn through a puzzle game:\n\n1. How to play: The letters are shuffled, and your job is to put them back into the word using its meaning or an example.\n2. Works offline: It's the only feature in the app you can use without an internet connection.\n3. Limits: For now it's designed only for English as the language you're learning.",
  "privacyAiCoach": "AI Coach",
  "privacyAiCoachBody": "Hifive syncs your learning data to a private database so you can reach it from anywhere. When you use the AI Coach, requests are handled securely to give suggestions, and this data is never shared or kept for any other purpose.",
  "privacyCollectTitle": "1. Information we collect",
  "privacyCollectBody": "We collect information to provide a better service to everyone. This includes:\n• Personal data: When you sign up, we may collect your name, email address and profile photo.\n• Usage data: We collect how the Service is accessed and used, such as your device type, operating system version and time spent on pages.",
  "privacyUseTitle": "2. How we use your information",
  "privacyUseBody": "We use the data we collect for several purposes:\n• To provide and maintain our Service\n• To tell you about changes to our Service\n• To let you take part in interactive features when you choose to\n• To provide customer support\n• To gather analysis or useful information so we can improve our Service",
  "privacyKeepTitle": "3. Keeping data",
  "privacyKeepBody": "Hifive keeps your Personal Data only as long as needed for the purposes in this Privacy Policy. We keep and use your Personal Data as far as needed to meet our legal obligations, resolve disputes and enforce our legal agreements and policies.",
  "privacySecurityTitle": "4. Keeping your data safe",
  "privacySecurityBody": "Keeping your data safe matters to us, but no method of sending data over the Internet or storing it electronically is 100% secure. While we use commercially acceptable means to protect your Personal Data, we can't guarantee its absolute security.",
  "privacyChildrenTitle": "5. Children's privacy",
  "privacyChildrenBody": "Our Service is not meant for anyone under 13. We don't knowingly collect personally identifiable information from anyone under 13. If you are a parent or guardian and know that your child has given us Personal Data, please contact us.",
  "privacyHeadline1": "We understand what you need,",
  "privacyHeadline2": "not who you are",
  "privacyUpdated": "Last updated: 7 January 2026",
  "privacyIntro": "Your privacy comes first. Our business runs on your support (subscriptions), not your data. Your information is stored safely in our encrypted database. We never share your personal data or what you use with AI with any third party, and we don't use it to train public AI models.",
