  "helpTitle0": "The story of hifive",
  "helpBody0": "hifive helps you learn a language every day the way you tend a garden: a little each day, until one day you look back at a whole forest.\n\nWhat the logo means\n\n• The five rounded bars are five fingers raised for a high five, a cheer after every session.\n• They are also the sound wave of a voice, because learning a language is about speaking and understanding each other.\n• The five colors are the ways you learn here: conversation (cyan), writing (blue), hifive's own indigo, grammar (violet) and AI (purple).\n\nThe hifive promise\n\nEvery word you meet anywhere in hifive, in flashcards, games or the dictionary, is followed until you can use it.",
